{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>A Yehudi.</b> Because he was from the kingdom of Yehudah, he was called thus." "<b>In Shushan the capital.</b> Because he was at the king's gate before the matter of Esther, therefore he dwells in the palace." "<b>Son of Kish.</b> He was great among his forefathers, and had he been the father of Saul, he would have mentioned Saul, for he was a king and not his father. Therefore it is not known whether Mordecai is of the sons of Saul or not." "<b>Yemini.</b> Defective [spelling] of 'son of' by way of abbreviation."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:30:05.824721811Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}